{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HEB","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"希伯來書","commonName":"希伯來書","title":"希伯來書","order":58,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"c71c20f4d63a28829bad75e93ad858a322dc4ffcbe1d504342fa88f19253826f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HEB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HEB/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":301},"chapter":{"number":5,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["凡從人間選出來的大祭司，都是受委任代表人辦理與上帝有關的事，為人的罪向上帝獻上禮物和贖罪祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他能體諒那些無知和迷失的人，因為他自己也受制於人性的軟弱。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["所以，他不但要為眾人的罪獻祭，也要為自己的罪獻祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["沒有人能自取這大祭司的尊榮，只有像亞倫一樣蒙上帝呼召的人才可以做大祭司。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["同樣，基督也沒有自取榮耀做大祭司，是上帝對祂說：",{"text":"「你是我的兒子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我今日成為你父親。」","poem":1},{"noteId":18}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["在聖經的另一處，上帝又說：",{"text":"「你照麥基洗德的模式永遠做祭司。」","poem":1},{"noteId":19}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["基督在世為人的時候，曾經聲淚俱下地祈求能救祂脫離死亡的上帝。祂因為敬虔而蒙了應允。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["基督雖然是上帝的兒子，仍然從所受的苦難中學習了順服。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["祂既然達到了純全的地步，就成了所有順服祂的人得到永恆救恩的源頭，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["並且被上帝照麥基洗德的模式立為大祭司。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["信徒要長進"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["關於這方面的事，我們還有很多話要說，但因為你們已經聽不進去，很難向你們解釋。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["按你們學習的時間來算，你們本該做別人的老師了，可惜你們還需要別人向你們傳授上帝話語的基本道理，成了不能吃乾糧、只能吃奶的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["因為只能吃奶的人還是嬰孩，不熟習公義之道。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["乾糧是給成年人吃的，他們的心思歷經鍛煉，能夠分辨善惡。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":18,"caller":"+","text":"詩篇2·7。","reference":{"chapter":5,"verse":5}},{"noteId":19,"caller":"+","text":"詩篇110·4。","reference":{"chapter":5,"verse":6}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HEB/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HEB/6.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HEB/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}